---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到｜Ansyn Lab" description="这个页面不存在，或仍未被构建。">
  <section class="not-found shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">ERROR / 404</p>
    <div class="not-found-code">04<span>4</span></div>
    <h1>这条路径还没有答案。</h1>
    <p>它可能被移动了，也可能只是还没开始构建。</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/">返回首页 →</a>
      <a class="button" href="/writing/">阅读公开笔记</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
